# This repo is a submodule build context for downstream consumers
# (docker-compose.yml's `context: ./services/earshot/src` in
# mormegil6/ambisonic-box). A submodule checkout carries the FULL repo tree,
# not the hand-curated subset a vendored copy used to have, so this is an
# explicit allowlist rather than a denylist: exclude everything, then
# un-exclude exactly what the Dockerfile's COPY/ADD instructions read.
#
# Keeps tester/ (Git LFS: a prebuilt ffmpeg binary + a wav fixture, ~45 MB,
# unused by this image), Cloudformation/, templates/, docs and repo metadata
# out of every build's context - none of it is needed, and none of it was
# vendored here before either.
**

!Dockerfile
!webtools
!webtools/**
!nginx-transcoder/nginx.conf
!nginx-transcoder/nginx-no-ssl.conf
!nginx-transcoder/static
!nginx-transcoder/static/**
!nginx-transcoder/entrypoint.sh
!nginx-transcoder/certbot.sh
!nginx-transcoder/direct-dash-gate.sh
!nginx-transcoder/ssl-options
!nginx-transcoder/ssl-options/**
